# Normalize all text files to LF in the working tree on every OS. This matches
# documenter's LF-based hashes, the Node/npm/editor defaults, and keeps diffs
# consistent across Linux, macOS, and Windows. Binary files are auto-detected and
# left untouched by `text=auto`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Be explicit about binary asset types this repo may accumulate (docs images), so
# they are never line-ending normalized regardless of auto-detection. Referenced
# SVG diagrams are deliberately left as text — they are diffable and documenter
# hashes them as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
